{"id": "68292", "title": "久不见桃花（女尊）", "author": "景一宝", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68292.htm", "intro": "NP文。引用一读者的话，这是NP界最好看的文。 \r\n翟景一从尊贵娇宠的宝郡主一步步走上帝王之位。桃花的大爱无边成就了她的半壁江山。费费的孤爱难鸣重置了国库丰盈。花魁是她生活上的左右手。 三个丈夫个个翻云覆雨，给读者一个全新的视野。大气，狂傲，经典，奢华。 \r\n景一宝将翟景一和花牡丹分开来写了。那一眼牡丹", "base": "files/article/html/68/68292", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10524394.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10524395.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10524396.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10524397.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10524398.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10524399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10524400.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10524401.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10524402.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10524403.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "10524404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "10524405.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-74完结", "file": "10524406.html", "available": false}]}